	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Mirum, quod nihil ad <persName ref="p1278">Gastium</persName> scribas nihilque mittas <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>hoc toto anno; occupationibus illud adscribere libens volo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/><persName ref="p458">Brentius</persName> vocatus a <persName ref="p1546">duce Wirtembergensi Christophoro</persName> et ab illo abductus, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quum nuper apud nos erat, quem servare vult in arce quadam, donec <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>dominus dederit ecclesiae suae feliciora tempora, et commode poteri[t] studiis suis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>in illis locis consulere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Tristitia adfectus est pius homo ob uxoris mortem, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quę illi reliquit sex liberos, quos cognatę educandos dedit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Unicum habet <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>filium VI annorum, quem ad se vocabit quemque dux beneficio ecclesiastico dotabit; <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nam cogitur in Montepellicardi omnes pfaffos recipere, qui hactenus latita<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>runt Besantii et iam Caesareanis literis animati omnia sua repetunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Princeps non audet detrectare, sed promittit omnia, quę papistę volunt et petunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> se fortiter adhuc gerit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Iam videmus, qualis pestis sit in civi<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tatibus mercatorum colluvies; illi enim in causa sunt, quod evangelium Christi <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ubique deletur, expungitur, pii proscribantur, crucem quod ferre cogantur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Augustę inquirit <persName>Caesar</persName> omnes absconditos thesauros in tribubus, quos co<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>guntur <persName ref="p18538">Caesari</persName> dare; sic damnum isti homines sibipsis accerserunt digni <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>crudeliori pęna et flagello nodosiori.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Marchionem <persName>Ernestum Badensem</persName> princi<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>pem Caesar ingenti pecuniarum summa mulctavit, etsi optimus sit <persName ref="p18538">Caesaris</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>amicus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Concionatorem <placeName>Pfortzensem</placeName> ab officio deposuit et adhuc pi<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>um virum proscribere vult ac cogitat.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l101">Colmarienses</placeName> dare coguntur <persName ref="p18538">Caesari</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>14000 fl., Selestadium 12000 fl., item reliquę civitates et abbates dabunt <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>etiam ingentem pecuniarum summam.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Conatur aliquid moliri aut contra <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nos aut contra Saxonicas civitates, quę adhuc ab evangelio stant <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>quęque fortissimę sunt ac nullo terrore moventur.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dominus <persName>Bürensis</persName> cr<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>apula obiit; sic pereunt miserrime hostes Christi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dux <placeName ref="l1041">Brunsvicensis</placeName> <persName ref="p6409">Henricus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>idem facit et filius, nullos habet in aula <placeName ref="l822">Germanos</placeName>, sed <placeName ref="l875">Hispa<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nos</placeName> et <placeName ref="l834">Italos</placeName>, quem sequitur episcopulus <placeName ref="l18">Augustanus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sic volunt sub iugum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>compellere <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName> fastum et superbiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Quidam <persName>Constantię</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ad templum <persName>Francis</persName> anorum, nam duo illuc venerunt requirentes altaria <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>etc.: "Vos estis, deus est testis, teterrima pestis."</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Indignati <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>sunt monachi, capitaneo <persName ref="p20184">Polwiler</persName> conquerentes qui risit <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>interrogans, an ita esset revera.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Episcopus <placeName ref="l1030">Wirtzburgensis</placeName> fuit apud <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Palatinum <placeName ref="l210">Heidelbergę</placeName> cum 60 equitibus; <persName>Palatino</persName> levavit filium e <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>baptismo.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Varia de isto puero, cuiusnam sit, sparguntur rumores, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>quos ego nolo cribere nec tutum est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>In <placeName ref="l631">Burgundt</placeName> haben ein frommen mann geköpfet, der zuͦ <placeName ref="l327">Mümpelgart</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>by 20 jaren gesessen; <foreign xml:lang="la">olim fuit sacerdos,</foreign> hat gelert laternen bletzen, dan <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>er ist hin und her also gezogen.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">Sy in gefragt von der meß und von <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>fleischessen; er hat gsagt mit wenig worten, die meß wirt nit gehalten, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>wie sy Christus ingesetzt hat; man hat vil darzuͦ gethon.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Ouch gsagt <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>vom fleischessen, das sey nit verbotten von gott, aber von menschen; man <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>möge es essen, wer do welle on sünde.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Da haben sy in angriffen, gefragt, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>wer er sy, von wannen.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Dorumb ist er</foreign> decollatus, qui noluit revocare, noluit <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>beneficium ecclesiasticum accipere et sacrificare.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Pius fuit homo et constans usque ad <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ultimum spiritum.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Pfaffi et monachi circumdederunt illum suis admonitionibus, sed nihil potuere <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>efficere; alias fuisset liberatus.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">20. Ianuarii 1549.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis nomine meo D. <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Ruͦdolphum</persName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="signature">[Unterschrift fehlt.]</note>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de">Dem ehrw<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>ürdigen und hochgelerten herren meyster <persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullinger</persName>, lutpriest<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>er zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>, mynem lieben, gunstigen herren.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
